{"id":"indien","lemma":"indien","pos":"adj","rank":2124,"glosses":["Indian (of, from or relating to India)","Indian (related to Amerinds)"],"ipa":"/ɛ̃.djɛ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/Fr-indien.ogg/Fr-indien.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"indienne","masculinePlural":"indiens","femininePlural":"indiennes"},"formAudio":{"indienne":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Pamputt-Indienne.wav","indiens":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-Indiens.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Mon grand-père était en partie indien.","en":"My grandfather was part Indian.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"big"},{"g":"father"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"in part, partly"]]},{"text":"Les indiens scalpaient leurs ennemis.","en":"The Native Americans scalped their enemies.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,null,{"g":"them","l":"leur"},{"g":"enemy","l":"ennemi"}]},{"text":"Il a enseigné au groupe de garçons indiens.","en":"He taught a group of Indian boys.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"taught"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"group"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"boy","l":"garçon"},null]},{"text":"C'est le meilleur restaurant indien où j'ai jamais mangé.","en":"This is the best Indian restaurant that I've ever eaten at.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"best, better"},{"g":"restaurant"},null,{"g":"where"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"}]},{"text":"Le cadeau a beaucoup plu aux Indiens.","en":"The gift delighted the Indians very much.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"present, gift"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"to rain","l":"pleuvoir"},{"g":"to the"},null]}]}